- Yes
{% /table %}

## Math

Inline math sits in a sentence, like {% inlineMath expression="e^{i\\pi} + 1 = 0" /%}, and block math gets its own line.

{% math expression="\\int_0^1 x^2\\,dx = \\frac{1}{3}" /%}

### A longer expression

{% math expression="\\sum_{k=1}^{n} k = \\frac{n(n+1)}{2}" /%}

## Closing thoughts

That is every component in one place. When you write your own post, delete what you do not need; a short post with a single heading works just as well, and the table of contents simply disappears when there is nothing to list.
